Upload

Client
   │
   ▼
POST /upload
   │
Controller
   │
Service
   │
Save File
   │
Uploads Folder


Download

Client
   │
   ▼
GET /download/{filename}
   │
Controller
   │
Service
   │
Read File
   │
Return Resource
   │
